  "policy_assessment": [
    "Actual production conftest excludes optional modules before import on default/core/base/mandatory roots with installed and absent extras. Additional root-dot, core --pyargs tests, actual native383 and retained19 use an import finder sentinel; zero real Lighteval imports and zero optional runtime test modules.",
    "Filesystem containment is canonical via resolve/is_relative_to and :: parsing. Canonical optional --pyargs rejects before resolution; real alias backstop rejects before optional test import. Inert optional initializer, marker-only rejection, profile/family conflicts, configured/environment filters and focused-versus-complete summaries are covered by naturally executed policy tests.",
    "Named optional qualification compares exact Counter ledger after selection and requires every expected call pass. Focused optional reports reject collection/setup/call/teardown skips and xfail/xpass. Setup/teardown failures and original nonzero exits cannot become qualification success. Core Config.fromdictargs callers and original RNG/Config fixtures pass without optional requests.",
    "Real missing package environment and actual missing langdetect reject before upstream import/download. Each real NLTK negative proves LookupError under an isolated actual nltk.data.path with the other resource present before actual production preflight; zero upstream/download events. Success preflight uses real installed API classes and reviewed versions/resources.",
    "Workflow has persistent step-level UV_PROJECT_ENVIRONMENT covering sync, resources, preflight, collection, pytest, verifier and typing. Repeated identity functions validate Python3.13, resolved prefixes, separate venv and lexical executable ownership; prerequisite/runtime/type/source receipts compare exact tuples. Actual uv correct/omitted/wrong identity regressions pass.",
    "Exact frozen workflow verifier accepts independently executed combined11 runtime/collection artifacts plus candidate source hashes, actual preflight/interpreter receipts and same-env strict typing. Eleven additional independent mutations reject omissions/substitutions/duplicates/extras, skipped/failure/error/xfail/xpass, inconsistent suite totals and duplicate collection.",
    "Artifact staging requires all nine optional records for success, excludes optional weights/Parquet and pytest aliases, preserves allowed small diagnostics and retained binary evidence. Ten independent complete/missing-record staging probes pass alongside existing guards.",
    "Implementation extends existing hooks and counters without new profile framework or backend bypass. Shared native/core/retained contracts, original evaluator code and dependency lock remain byte-identical. No maintainability defect requiring a change was found."
  ],
